section
	h1 CopyCode
	h3 for Reveal.js
	p.small Customized copy button with window style
	pre(data-cc-window="JavaScript")
		code.hljs.javascript(data-line-numbers, style="font-size: 1em").
			let why = `Because we always want to copy code during our presentations, right?`
		//-

section
	h3 Configuring CopyCode
	pre
		code.hljs.javascript.
			copycode: { timeout: 1200, button: "always", display: "icons", style: { copybg: "transparent", copiedbg: "white", copycolor: "white", copiedbg: "transparent"}, window: { controls: "light", controlsOpacity: 0.5, padding: "1rem" } }
		//-

	p.small Add the above code to the Reveal.js configuration, and you will get a window-mode and button as shown here.

section
	p This is just an example file to show a customized copy button. For more CopyCode options, check the #[a(href="demo.html") demo].